<title>KENYA: RALLYING-SAFARI RALLY LEADING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-SAFARI RALLY LEADING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
